<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_legendarygem_05.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Celestial Dungeon Gear for Restoration Druids</span></h2>This list represents the best gear available strictly from Celestial dungeons &amp; August Stone Fragments in Phase 3 of Mists of Pandaria Classic, although it's important to remember that combining item sources is the best way to gear early on. Players should sim the gear they actually have available to them in QE Live to determine which pieces to wear. <br/>
