<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Restoration Druids</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings with it a whole lot of world content, with the chance to get powerful gear. The best of which drops from powerful World Bosses like Nalak and Oondasta.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="oondasta">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_hunter_pet_devilsaur.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Oondasta</span></h3>Oondasta drops 522 ilvl items so he's well worth killing every week. You can find him on the Isle of Giants. He drops the following:<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95177/choker-of-stygimolochy">
<img alt="Choker of Stygimolochy" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_124.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Choker of Stygimolochy</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95186/belt-of-crushed-dreams">
<img alt="Belt of Crushed Dreams" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_leather_raidmonk_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of Crushed Dreams</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95147/fancifully-frilled-tunic">
<img alt="Fancifully Frilled Tunic" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_raidmonk_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fancifully Frilled Tunic</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95195/gloves-of-unliving-fossil">
<img alt="Gloves of Unliving Fossil" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_leather_raiddruid_m_01glove.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of Unliving Fossil</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95163/ring-of-shamuru">
<img alt="Ring of Shamuru" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_174.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Shamuru</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95164/eye-of-oondasta">
<img alt="Eye of Oondasta" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eye of Oondasta</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="nalak">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pandarenserpentgodmount_black.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Nalak</span></h3>Nalak drops ilvl-522 Tier 15 legs and gloves as well as various ilvl-496 "Tyrannical Gladiator" pieces. You'll want to kill Nalak every week for a chance at these powerful items.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="galleon-warbands">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon and Salyis' Warband</span></h3>Galleon drops ilvl-496 items which can be very appealing for when you're getting started.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90430/stomphowl-pendant">
<img alt="Stomphowl Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_108.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stomphowl Pendant</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90410/cap-of-wandering-pride">
<img alt="Cap of Wandering Pride" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_leather_raiddruid_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cap of Wandering Pride</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90450/carrot-holder-belt">
<img alt="Carrot-Holder Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_leather_raiddruid_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Carrot-Holder Belt</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90434/steaming-seal-of-flame">
<img alt="Steaming Seal of Flame" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_150.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Steaming Seal of Flame</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>Sha of Anger is notable in that it drops ilvl-496 Tier 14 legs and gloves as well as various ilvl-483 Malevolent Gladiator's pieces. While not as important in Phase 3, it's still a decent outlet to grab an epic for little effort - particularly before Celestial dungeons are available.<br/>
<br/>The first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it'll also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90908/crushing-treads-of-anger">
<img alt="Crushing Treads of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_leather_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crushing Treads of Anger</span></a>, a strong early pair of early boots.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Reputation for Restoration Druids in Phase 3</span></h2>Reputation gear is of quite high item level (even higher than Celestial Dungeons) but costs <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, which is limited. In Phase 3 you can mostly ignore reputations outside of Shado-Pan Assault since they take quite a while to grind to a good reputation level and catch up gear is better anyway.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="shado-pan-assault">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Shado-Pan Assault</span></h3>Shado-Pan Assault is a new faction in 5.5.2 that offers some very nice item level rewards - even at the Friendly reputation level.<br/>
<br/>
