<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="dominance-offensive">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/pvpcurrency-honor-horde.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Dominance Offensive /<wbr/> Operation Shieldwall <span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/pvpcurrency-honor-alliance.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span></span></h3>This faction was added in 5.5.1 and offers some medium item-level valor pieces and a few interesting trinkets. You won't equip anything here over Celestial items and I'd recommend focusing on Shado-Pan Assault instead.<br/>
<br/>
